# Local dev convenience: a temporary workspace manifest that lets `cmd/` and `bench/`
# resolve the not-yet-published `aurasuisui/multiindex` while developing. It is NOT
# committed on purpose: `moon publish` packages whatever sits in the module directory
# (verified with `moon publish --dry-run`), and the published artifact should not carry
# a workspace manifest (same rule as the author's moonbit-bimap). Recipe (verified):
#   printf 'members = [".", "bench", "cmd/leaderboard"]\n' > moon.work
#   moon run cmd/leaderboard && moon run --release bench/main.mbt
#   rm moon.work
moon.work
